:"95fdfb43-6592-404a-8f65-4bdfb857107c","number":"74","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":75,"createdAt":"2024-10-15T02:20:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"1683bc4b-9857-4b73-bc78-86e128715f82","number":"73","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":70,"createdAt":"2024-10-15T02:18:56+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5bc39fe2-4412-420e-90e3-a7b4b898d738","number":"72","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":63,"createdAt":"2024-10-15T02:17:33+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"de10deed-5880-4862-8891-237bb16786e4","number":"71","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":65,"createdAt":"2024-08-28T01:24:37+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"51d5eccc-44d3-42ea-a4b1-82d9dee632e6","number":"70","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":74,"createdAt":"2024-08-27T04:30:41+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":109,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:29:35.008Z"},"4338f69e-df9d-464e-bd63-f0863281df6e":{"id":"4338f69e-df9d-464e-bd63-f0863281df6e","title":"Danggol","altTitle":"당골","description":"At Yeongweoldang shrine lives Kim Seo-ryeong, a veteran mansin (female shaman). Noh Seung-rae, who was born into a shaman family yet has spent his life rejecting the calling, seeks her help because his young daughter has suddenly lost her sight.\n\nOffended by Seung-rae’s scornful disbelief in shamanism, Seo-ryeong turns him down and leaves. But that very night — and every night after — unsettling dreams invade Seo-ryeong’s sleep, showing her fragments of Seung-rae’s past.\n\nUnable to ignore the signs, she starts investigating the household… and the aura surrounding that little girl is anything but ordinary!","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Thriller","Psychological","Philosophical","Horror","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4338f69e-df9d-464e-bd63-f0863281df6e/5d37f753-3be3-482d-a4e0-bd4a55774d3d.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":null,"follows":90,"listAt":"2026-10-22T19:00:49.018Z","chapters":[{"id":"724ec0f0-789c-4209-8aaf-7ee980639fb8","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2025-05-26T19:28:47+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"e5cb83c1-35f4-48f5-baae-eaba6f4296db","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2025-05-17T15:32:34+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ee1046d5-bea3-4f72-92b4-a86910c54fcc","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2025-05-14T23:15:29+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6d923b84-7fe0-42ef-896e-4172380446cb","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":42,"createdAt":"2025-05-11T18:14:43+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:32:28.619Z"},"2b5a3b43-effb-4f54-aa9b-d6093d523452":{"id":"2b5a3b43-effb-4f54-aa9b-d6093d523452","title":"Silent Witch: Chinmoku no Majo no Kakushigoto","altTitle":"Secrets of the Silent Witch","description":"Keajaiban tidak membutuhkan nyanyian. Ini adalah kisah tentang penyihir terlemah, paling pemalu, namun terkuat, dan bagaimana dia dilahirkan kembali, semuanya menjadi sebuah buku. (Penyihir Keheningan) Monica Everett. Satu-satunya penyihir di dunia yang bisa menggunakan sihir diam (tanpa nyanyian), dan seorang pahlawan muda yang membunuh sendiri naga hitam legendaris itu. Tapi apa sifat aslinya?? Alasan sebenarnya saya berlatih sihir diam adalah agar saya tidak perlu berbicara di depan umum. Ketika Monica terpilih sebagai salah satu dari 7 Watchers, tanpa disadari, dia terpaksa mengambil misi rahasia untuk melindungi pangeran kedua…? Lemah dan pemalu, namun yang terkuat. Penyihir surgawi yang antisosial menyembunyikan identitas aslinya dan diam-diam membawa kejahatan ke pengadilan melawan pangeran dalam fantasi yang menyakitkan! Fantasi penyihir web, terlahir kembali menjadi sebuah buku, dengan tambahan! Apa yang akan menjadi misteri baru yang berdiri di depan Monica Everett…?","year":2021,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"co